ault configuration hash','','none'),(6647,_binary 'Label of the action','','none'),(6648,_binary 'Authored on @date','','none'),(6649,_binary 'Enter the value for the sizes attribute, for example: %example_sizes.','','none'),(6650,_binary 'Unique machine name of the vocabulary.','','none'),(6651,_binary 'Field %field set in %filter is not usable for this filter type. Combined field filter only works for simple fields.','','none'),(6652,_binary 'Account %name has been deleted.','','none'),(6653,_binary 'Renders an entity in a view mode.','','none'),(6654,_binary 'Add @entity-type','','11.2.5'),(6655,_binary 'Revision create time','','11.2.5'),(6656,_binary 'Is default revision','','none'),(6657,_binary 'The moderation state of this piece of content.','','none'),(6658,_binary 'Moderation control','','none'),(6659,_binary 'Revisions must be required when moderation is enabled.','','none'),(6660,_binary 'Revisions are required.','','none'),(6661,_binary 'The moderation state has been updated.','','none'),(6662,_binary 'When content reaches this state it should be published.','','none'),(6663,_binary 'Default revision','','11.2.5'),(6664,_binary 'When content reaches this state it should be made the default revision; this is implied for published states.','','none'),(6665,_binary 'Valid moderation state','Validation','none'),(6666,_binary 'Field identifier','','none'),(6667,_binary 'Scale','decimal places','none'),(6668,_binary 'If this style is in use on the site, you may select another style to replace it. All images that have been generated for this style will be permanently deleted. If no replacement style is selected, the dependent configurations might need manual reconfiguration.','','none'),(6669,_binary 'All images that have been generated for this style will be permanently deleted. The dependent configurations might need manual reconfiguration.','','none'),(6670,_binary '- No replacement -','','none'),(6671,_binary 'Antigua & Barbuda','','none'),(6672,_binary 'Divider','','none'),(6673,_binary 'The BigPipe module sends pages with dynamic content in a way that allows browsers to show them much faster. For more information, see the <a href=\":big_pipe-documentation\">online documentation for the BigPipe module</a>.','','none'),(6674,_binary 'The module requires no configuration. Every part of the page contains metadata that allows BigPipe to figure this out on its own.','','none'),(6675,_binary 'Size of email field','','none'),(6676,_binary 'Did not save to map table due to NULL value for key field @field','','none'),(6677,_binary 'A boolean indicating whether the node is visible on the front page.','','none'),(6678,_binary 'A boolean indicating whether the node should sort to the top of content lists.','','none'),(6679,_binary 'Default argument validator','','none'),(6680,_binary 'Operations on Unicode strings are emulated on a best-effort basis. Install the <a href=\"http://php.net/mbstring\">PHP mbstring extension</a> for improved Unicode support.','','none'),(6681,_binary 'The %entity_type entity type needs to be installed.','','none'),(6682,_binary 'The %entity_type entity type needs to be updated.','','none'),(6683,_binary 'The %field_name field needs to be installed.','','none'),(6684,_binary 'The %field_name field needs to be updated.','','none'),(6685,_binary 'The %field_name field needs to be uninstalled.','','none'),(6686,_binary 'Custom text: @true_label / @false_label','','none'),(6687,_binary 'Display: @true_label / @false_label','','none'),(6688,_binary 'See <a href=\"http://php.net/manual/function.date.php\" target=\"_blank\">the documentation for PHP date formats</a>.','','none'),(6689,_binary 'Language list ID','','none'),(6690,_binary 'Completed step @current of @total.','','none'),(6691,_binary 'This site has only a single language enabled. <a href=\":language_url\">Add at least one more language</a> in order to translate content.','','none'),(6692,_binary 'Describe a time by reference to the current day, like \'+90 days\' (90 days from the day the field is created) or \'+1 Saturday\' (the next Saturday). See <a href=\"http://php.net/manual/function.strtotime.php\">strtotime</a> for more details.','','none'),(6693,_binary 'The type of the log entry, for example \"user\" or \"page not found\".','','none'),(6694,_binary 'The %field_type_label field type is used in the following field: @fieldsThe %field_type_label field type is used in the following fields: @fields','','none'),(6695,_binary 'File MIME Type','','none'),(6696,_binary 'This module is experimental. <a href=\":url\">Experimental modules</a> are provided for testing purposes only. Use at your own risk.','','none'),(6697,_binary 'The maximum allowed image size expressed as WIDTH×HEIGHT (e.g. 640×480). Leave blank for no restriction. If a larger image is uploaded, it will be resized to reflect the given width and height. Resizing images on upload will cause the loss of <a href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchangeable_image_file_format\">EXIF data</a> in the image.','','none'),(6698,_binary 'The domain names to use for these languages. <strong>Modifying this value may break existing URLs. Use with caution in a production environment.</strong> Example: Specifying \"de.example.com\" as language domain for German will result in a URL like \"http://de.example.com/contact\".','','none'),(6699,_binary 'URL query key value pairs','','none'),(6700,_binary 'URL fragment','','none'),(6701,_binary 'Operation stopped by request','','none'),(6702,_binary 'Operation on @migration failed','','none'),(6703,_binary 'Operation on @migration skipped due to unfulfilled dependencies','','none'),(6704,_binary 'Currently upgrading @migration (@current of @max total tasks)','','none'),(6705,_binary 'Upgrade process not completed','','none'),(6706,_binary 'Congratulations, you upgraded Drupal!','','none'),(6707,_binary 'Review the detailed upgrade log','','none'),(6708,_binary 'Completed 1 upgrade task successfullyCompleted @count upgrade tasks successfully','','none'),(6709,_binary '1 upgrade failed@count upgrades failed','','none'),(6710,_binary 'Put this site into <a href=\":url\">maintenance mode</a>.','','none'),(6711,_binary 'Source database','','none'),(6712,_binary 'Provide credentials for the database of the Drupal site you want to upgrade.','','none'),(6713,_binary 'Source files','','none'),(6714,_binary 'Review upgrade','','none'),(6715,_binary 'Perform upgrade','','none'),(6716,_binary 'Running upgrade','','none'),(6717,_binary 'Control which roles can \"View the administration theme\" on the <a href=\":permissions\">Permissions page</a>.','','none'),(6718,_binary 'Create and manage fields, forms, and display settings for your content.','','11.2.5'),(6719,_binary 'The language code of the URL alias.','','none'),(6720,_binary 'The Syslog module logs events by sending messages to the logging facility of your web server\'s operating system. Syslog is an operating system administrative logging tool that provides valuable information for use in system management and security auditing. Most suited to medium and large sites, Syslog provides filtering tools that allow messages to be routed by type and severity. For more information, see the <a href=\":syslog\">online documentation for the Syslog module</a>, as well as PHP\'s documentation pages for the <a href=\"http://php.net/manual/function.openlog.php\">openlog</a> and <a href=\"http://php.net/manual/function.syslog.php\">syslog</a> functions.','','none'),(6721,_binary 'Experimental modules found: %module_list. <a href=\":url\">Experimental modules</a> are provided for testing purposes only. Use at your own risk.','','none'),(6722,_binary 'PHP OPcode caching can improve your site\'s performance considerably. It is <strong>highly recommended</strong> to have <a href=\"http://php.net/manual/opcache.installation.php\" target=\"_blank\">OPcache</a> installed on your server.','','none'),(6723,_binary 'Protection disabled','','none'),(6724,_binary '<a href=\":url\">Experimental modules</a> are provided for testing purposes only. Use at your own risk.','','none'),(6725,_binary 'The vocabulary name.','','none'),(6726,_binary 'Name (autocomplete)','','none'),(6727,_binary 'The user or author name. Uses an autocomplete widget to find a user name, the actual filter uses the resulting user ID.','','none'),(6728,_binary 'When printing URL paths, how to transform the case of the filter value. Do not use this unless with Postgres as it uses case sensitive comparisons.','','none'),(6729,_binary 'Specify which display or custom URL this display will link to.','','none'),(6730,_binary 'This will add a more link to the bottom of this view, which will link to the page view. If you have more than one page view, the link will point to the display specified in \'Link display\' section under pager. You can override the URL at the link display setting.','','none'),(6731,_binary 'When printing URL paths, how to transform the case of the filter value.','','none'),(6732,_binary 'This identifier has illegal characters.','','none'),(6733,_binary 'The field that is going to be used as the OPML URL attribute for each row.','','none'),(6734,_binary '[user:display-name],\n\nYour account on [site:name] has been blocked.\n\n--  [site:name] team','','11.2.5'),(6735,_binary 'Module Permissions','','none'),(6736,_binary 'workspace','','none'),(6737,_binary 'Activate Workspace','','none'),(6738,_binary 'Would you like to activate the %workspace workspace?','','none'),(6739,_binary 'The workspace name.','','none'),(6740,_binary 'The workspace owner.','','none'),(6741,_binary 'The time that the workspace was last edited.','','none'),(6742,_binary 'The user ID of the user on which the log entry was written.','','none'),(6743,_binary 'Bundle assigned to the auto-created entities.','','none'),(6744,_binary 'Add a new @entity_type.','','none'),(6745,_binary 'There is no @entity_type yet. @add_link','','none'),(6746,_binary 'Store new items in