the @required theme to install @theme.You must install the @required themes to install @theme.','','none'),(10178,_binary 'Revert all term revisions','','11.2.5'),(10179,_binary 'Delete all term revisions','','11.2.5'),(10180,_binary 'View all term revisions','','11.2.5'),(10181,_binary 'View vocabulary labels','','11.2.5'),(10182,_binary '%vocabulary: View term revisions','','11.2.5'),(10183,_binary '%vocabulary: Revert term revisions','','11.2.5'),(10184,_binary 'To revert a revision you also need permission to edit the taxonomy term.','','11.2.5'),(10185,_binary '%vocabulary: Delete term revisions','','11.2.5'),(10186,_binary 'To delete a revision you also need permission to delete the taxonomy term.','','11.2.5'),(10187,_binary 'Create a new revision by default for this vocabulary.','','none'),(10188,_binary 'Taxonomy term hierarchy','Validation','none'),(10189,_binary 'Ideal for titles and names that need to support markup such as bold, italics or links','','none'),(10190,_binary 'Good for fields with known or predictable lengths','','none'),(10191,_binary 'Ideal for longer texts, like body or description without a summary','','none'),(10192,_binary 'Ideal for longer texts, like body or description with a summary','','none'),(10193,_binary 'Allows specifying a summary for the text','','none'),(10194,_binary 'This project has been labeled insecure by the Drupal security team, and is no longer available for download. Immediately uninstalling everything included by this project is strongly recommended!','','none'),(10195,_binary 'This project has been revoked, and is no longer available for download. Uninstalling everything included by this project is strongly recommended!','','none'),(10196,_binary 'This project is no longer supported, and is no longer available for download. Uninstalling everything included by this project is strongly recommended!','','none'),(10197,_binary 'Your currently installed release has been revoked, and is no longer available for download. Uninstalling everything included in this release or upgrading is strongly recommended!','','none'),(10198,_binary 'Your currently installed release is now unsupported, is no longer available for download and no update is available. Uninstalling everything included in this release is strongly recommended!','','none'),(10199,_binary 'Your currently installed release is now unsupported, and is no longer available for download. Uninstalling everything included in this release or upgrading is strongly recommended!','','none'),(10200,_binary 'View software update notifications','','11.2.5'),(10201,_binary 'Ensure that site administrators have this permission so that security updates are applied promptly.','','11.2.5'),(10202,_binary 'The anonymous user does not exist. See the <a href=\":url\">restore the anonymous (user ID 0) user record</a> for more information','','none'),(10203,_binary 'Are you sure you want to log out?','','none'),(10204,_binary 'View %view depends on role %role, but the role does not exist.','','none'),(10205,_binary 'Pager header element','','none'),(10206,_binary 'setDisplay() called with invalid display ID \"@display_id\".','','none'),(10207,_binary 'Installing the appropriate module may solve this issue. Otherwise, check to see if there is a module update available.','','none'),(10208,_binary 'Default: @plugin_title','','none'),(10209,_binary 'Choose a heading level equal to or one lower than the preceding header.','','none'),(10210,_binary 'This @entity_type_label can only be deleted in the Live workspace.','','none'),(10211,_binary 'Save and switch','','none'),(10212,_binary '%label is now the active workspace.','','none'),(10213,_binary 'The content is being edited in the @label workspace. As a result, your changes cannot be saved.','','none'),(10214,_binary 'Umami is an example food magazine website that demonstrates some of the features of Drupal core. It is intended to be used as an example site, rather than as a foundation for building your own site. For more information, see the <a href=\":demo_umami\">online documentation for the Umami installation profile</a>.','','none'),(10215,_binary 'Demonstrating Drupal core functionality','','none'),(10216,_binary 'You can look around the site to get ideas for what kinds of features Drupal is capable of, and to see how an actual site can be built using Drupal core.','','none'),(10217,_binary 'The Umami profile is very handy if you are developing a feature and need some sample content.','','none'),(10218,_binary 'What to do when you are ready to build your Drupal website','','none'),(10219,_binary 'Once you\'ve tried Drupal using Umami and want to build your own site, simply reinstall Drupal and select a different installation profile (such as Standard) from the install screen.','','none'),(10220,_binary 'Toggle the menu','','none'),(10221,_binary 'Enter color in hexadecimal format (#abc123).','','none'),(10222,_binary 'Get support and chat with the Drupal community on <a href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> or <a href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a>. When you’re looking for a solution to a problem, go to <a href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal Support</a> or <a href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Answers on Stack Exchange</a>.','','11.2.5'),(10223,_binary 'Starterkit theme','','none'),(10224,_binary 'Install required modules','','none'),(10225,_binary 'Install recipe','','none'),(10226,_binary 'Installing required modules','','none'),(10227,_binary 'Starting required module installation.','','none'),(10228,_binary 'Required module installation has encountered an error.','','none'),(10229,_binary 'Installing recipe','','none'),(10230,_binary 'Starting recipe installation.','','none'),(10231,_binary 'Recipe installation has encountered an error.','','none'),(10232,_binary 'Simple configuration update','','none'),(10233,_binary '@entity_type @method','','none'),(10234,_binary '@admin_label (multiple calls)','','none'),(10235,_binary 'A backup checkpoint was not created